OL,3,ATwo charged with national security
OL,4,Aoffences over RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fwith national security offences over
OL,8,Fthe incident at RAF Fairford in
OL,9,FSeptember, with one suspected of
OL,10,Fassisting Iran's intelligence service.
OL,12,FMohmed Ahmad Abdulkarim, 24, has been
OL,13,Fcharged with assisting a foreign
OL,14,Fintelligence service after the incident
OL,15,Fnear the airbase in Gloucestershire.
OL,17,FNouman Essghir, also 24, has been
OL,18,Fcharged with entering a prohibited
OL,19,Fplace for a purpose prejudicial to the
OL,20,FUK a month earlier on 22 August. Both
OL,21,Fmen will appear at Westminster
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
